## 5. Core Functional Modules

| Module | Function | Input | Output |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **Data Layer** | Ingest & normalize tick/minute data. | Gold, DXY, timestamps. | OHLCV, aligned datasets. |
| **Feature Engine** | Compute indicators & structure features. | Clean data. | VWAP, RSI, EMA, DXY correlation. |
| **Rule Engine** | Apply SOP logic & scoring. | Feature data. | Trade signals (≥8/10). |
| **Backtester** | Simulate trades & validate logic. | Historical data. | PnL, win rate, adherence %. |
| **Risk Module** | Enforce PDLL, PDPT, and scaling rules. | SOP config. | Auto-halts & logs. |
| **LLM Enforcer** | Enforce playbook alignment for each trade. | Market data | Go/No go, reasoning, insights |
| **ML Layer** | Learn from history & outcomes. | Logs + metrics. | Optimized weights, insights. |
| **Dashboard** | Display analytics & performance. | Aggregated results. | Streamlit / Dash interface. |

